<title>JAPAN: Fuji Bank says listing on New York a possibility.</title>
<headline>Fuji Bank says listing on New York a possibility.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fuji Bank Ltd said on Friday that it sees the listing of its shares in New York as a possibility in the long term.  </p>
<p>&quot;Listing in New York is in our medium- to long-term scope,&quot; a Fuji Bank senior official told a news conference without elaborating.</p>
</text>
